{"text": "El granjero comenzó a imaginar montones de monedas. Pensó que un huevo diario era demasiado poco. Se quedó junto al nido toda la mañana esperando otro. La gallina lo miraba, pero no ponía más huevos por mucho que él insistiera. Granjero: Si pusieras diez hoy, tendríamos mucho más.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.330624, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.345375, "end": 0.921333, "from": 3, "to": 11}, {"start": 0.936125, "end": 1.467791, "from": 12, "to": 19}, {"start": 1.482541, "end": 1.541624, "from": 20, "to": 21}, {"start": 1.556375, "end": 2.220958, "from": 22, "to": 30}, {"start": 2.235708, "end": 2.915041, "from": 31, "to": 39}, {"start": 2.929833, "end": 3.003666, "from": 40, "to": 42}, {"start": 3.018458, "end": 3.756874, "from": 43, "to": 50}, {"start": 4.784958, "end": 5.227999, "from": 52, "to": 57}, {"start": 5.242791, "end": 5.390457, "from": 58, "to": 61}, {"start": 5.40525, "end": 5.582458, "from": 62, "to": 64}, {"start": 5.59725, "end": 5.877833, "from": 65, "to": 70}, {"start": 5.892583, "end": 6.365166, "from": 71, "to": 77}, {"start": 6.379958, "end": 6.586708, "from": 78, "to": 81}, {"start": 6.6015, "end": 7.251291, "from": 82, "to": 91}, {"start": 7.266083, "end": 7.738666, "from": 92, "to": 96}, {"start": 8.757666, "end": 9.023499, "from": 98, "to": 100}, {"start": 9.038291, "end": 9.348416, "from": 101, "to": 106}, {"start": 9.363166, "end": 9.688082, "from": 107, "to": 112}, {"start": 9.702875, "end": 9.821041, "from": 113, "to": 115}, {"start": 9.835791, "end": 10.160707, "from": 116, "to": 120}, {"start": 10.175458, "end": 10.529916, "from": 121, "to": 125}, {"start": 10.544666, "end": 10.662832, "from": 126, "to": 128}, {"start": 10.677583, "end": 11.164958, "from": 129, "to": 135}, {"start": 11.179708, "end": 11.814749, "from": 136, "to": 145}, {"start": 11.8295, "end": 12.272541, "from": 146, "to": 150}, {"start": 13.291583, "end": 13.483583, "from": 152, "to": 154}, {"start": 13.498333, "end": 14.015208, "from": 155,